1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,320
All right the beans are cooked.
好了，豆子煮熟了。

2
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:06,240
Now I'm adding some pork onions and jalapenos and yellow lentils and rice.
现在我加入猪肉、洋葱、墨西哥辣椒、黄扁豆和米饭。

3
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:13,800
Cook so fre a.
字幕接着识别为 cook so fre a，这一小段说法尚待听辨。

4
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,680
Oh man I just dumped about half my beans in the fire.
哎呀，我刚把大约一半的豆子倒进火里了。

5
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:20,479
My little pot hanger broke and dumped half my food in the fire.
我的小锅吊架断了，把一半的食物都倒进火里了。

6
00:00:20,479 --> 00:00:29,840
Well I guess that's why you bring extra right.
好吧，我想这就是要多带一点食物的原因，对吧。

7
00:00:37,039 --> 00:00:49,640
Look at that got my tortillas warming up in the gravel.
看，我的薄饼正放在碎石里加热。

8
00:00:49,640 --> 00:00:54,479
Got crispy pork side beans and rice m batas and tortillas.
有酥脆的猪肉、豆子和米饭，还有字幕识别为 m batas 的食物以及薄饼；食物名待听辨。

9
00:00:54,479 --> 00:00:59,800
That is a meal fit for a king right there.
这简直是国王级别的一餐。

10
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:09,599
That is so so delicious.
真的太好吃了。

11
00:01:09,599 --> 00:01:29,759
Oh that was good I am so full.
哦，真好吃，我吃得特别饱。

12
00:01:50,120 --> 00:02:01,200
All right there we go well it's late and it's getting really really cold.
好了，就这样。现在已经晚了，而且越来越冷了。

13
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:17,760
I think it's time to hop in my bag and I'll see you guys in the morning.
我想该钻进睡袋了，我们明早见。

14
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:26,560
Oh my goodness it is cold I think I need to get some water boiling and make something warm to drink.
我的天，真冷。我想得烧点水，弄点热饮。

15
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:30,719
The fire went out around 2 00 a m so I woke up and put some wood on it.
火大约凌晨两点熄了，所以我醒来添了一些木头。

16
00:02:30,719 --> 00:02:36,120
And when I looked up there was the best northern lights display I have seen in a long time.
当我抬起头时，看到了很久以来见过的最美的一次极光。

17
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:38,599
They stretched from horizon to horizon.
它们从一侧地平线一直延伸到另一侧。

18
00:02:38,599 --> 00:02:42,240
I got out of my bag and set up my gopro and I tried to record it.
我爬出睡袋，架好 GoPro，想把它录下来。

19
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:46,670
But it is really hard to record the northern lights unless there's a moon out as well.
不过，除非月亮也出来，否则极光真的很难拍到。

20
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:51,560
But I used my cell phone to take some pictures and those turned out really well.
但我用手机拍了几张照片，效果非常好。

21
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:56,000
But I sat in bed and watched the northern lights for like an hour before I fell back asleep.
然后我在睡袋里躺着，看了大约一个小时的极光，才又睡着。

22
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:57,760
It was it was pretty cool.
那确实非常酷。

23
00:02:57,760 --> 00:03:04,080
The northern lights kind of goes through these cycles and this year is supposed to be a really good year to see the northern lights.
极光好像有一定周期，而据说他拍摄的这一年特别适合看极光。

24
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:12,640
I think I only saw them three or four times last year but so far this year this is my third time seeing them.
我想去年我只看到过三四次，不过今年到现在，这已经是第三次了。

25
00:03:12,640 --> 00:03:18,039
Oh my pants have frost on them I'm going to warm these up.
哎呀，我裤子上都结霜了，我要把它暖一暖。

26
00:03:18,039 --> 00:03:22,039
This herbal tea comes in a jelly and it's passion fruit puree.
这种花草茶是果冻状的，里面是百香果果泥。

27
00:03:22,039 --> 00:03:28,599
It's got bits of seeds and everything in it this stuff's so wonderful.
里面有籽之类的颗粒，这东西真不错。

28
00:03:28,599 --> 00:03:32,080
I made this mug from a cow horn I also made this griddle.
这个杯子是我用牛角做的，这块煎板也是我自己做的。

29
00:03:32,080 --> 00:03:34,920
Quite a few of my bush crafting tools I make myself.
我的不少丛林手作用具都是自己做的。

30
00:03:34,920 --> 00:03:43,760
I did a video on how to make all this stuff about a year ago I'll put a link in the video description below.
大约一年前，我拍过如何制作这些东西的视频，会把链接放在下面的视频简介里。

31
00:03:43,760 --> 00:03:47,120
Got some pork jow bacon left over for my last trip.
我这里还有上次旅行剩下的、字幕写作 pork jow bacon 的猪肉培根。

32
00:03:47,120 --> 00:04:11,560
Going to let that cook right there there we go.
把它放在这里烹煮，好了。

33
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:17,159
A buttery hot tortilla covered in cinnamon and sugar.
一张热乎乎、带黄油的薄饼，上面撒着肉桂和糖。

34
00:04:17,159 --> 00:04:29,500
If you like cinnamon toast you're going to like this buttery cinnamon and sugar tortillas not bad.
如果你喜欢肉桂吐司，应该也会喜欢这种黄油肉桂糖薄饼，挺不错。
